@startuml credits-balance
title Reading the balance (BillingAccountBalance)

actor Customer
participant "cloud-portal" as Portal
participant "Milo API server" as Milo
participant "Billing provider\nusage API server" as Usage
participant "Billing provider\nbackend" as Backend

Customer -> Portal : Open the billing page
Portal -> Milo : GET .../organizations/acme/control-plane/apis/\nusage.billing.miloapis.com/v1alpha1/namespaces/\norganization-acme/billingaccountbalances/acme-main\n(user's token)
Milo -> Milo : authenticate,\ncheck billingaccountbalances.get on Organization acme
Milo -> Usage : forward (parent: Organization acme)
Usage -> Usage : scope: acme-main must be\nin organization-acme
Usage -> Backend : credit balance of acme-main\n(after usage metered so far)
Backend --> Usage : available 499.90, booked 500.00, pending 0
Usage -> Backend : this period's usage, priced\nas the invoice will price it
Backend --> Usage : charges 0.10
Usage -> Backend : active grants
Backend --> Usage : welcome-acme, $500, expires 2027-01-18
Usage --> Portal : status: credits {available, booked, pending},\ncurrentPeriod {charges, creditsApplied, amountDue},\ngrants[]
Portal --> Customer : "$499.90 credit · $0.10 this period · $0 due"
note over Usage, Backend : nothing is stored in Milo:\nevery GET reads the provider
@enduml
